{"id":"n30206-1-31","stage":1,"title":"땅 · 地面","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n30206-1-31-1","ko":"땅이 흔들리는 것 같아.","zh":"感觉地面在震动呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"땅이","meaning":"地面","explanation":"땅 在这里指脚下的地面；不是与海洋相对的“大陆”。","readings":[{"term":"땅","audio":"/audio/f330041e9e005a6bf8b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30206","senseId":"1","lemma":"땅","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"땅이","audio":"/audio/6769a57b2910d067faa2.mp3"}},{"text":"흔들리는","meaning":"摇晃、震动","explanation":"흔들리다 指地面来回晃动；本句未说明是巨响或冲击引起。","readings":[{"term":"흔들리다","audio":"/audio/60a91a20c2ca370e0404.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89241","senseId":"1","lemma":"흔들리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흔들리는","audio":"/audio/34e2af7731ab9205b7c0.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f330041e9e005a6b","term":"땅","zh":"地面","audio":"/audio/f330041e9e005a6bf8b4.mp3","entryId":"30206","definition":"脚下的土地或地表；本句说感觉地面在震动。","pronunciation":["땅"]},{"id":"60a91a20c2ca370e","term":"흔들리다","zh":"摇晃、震动","audio":"/audio/60a91a20c2ca370e0404.mp3","entryId":"89241","definition":"地面发生晃动，可能是地震。","pronunciation":["흔들리다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/1c623b77051399767226.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n30206-1-31-2","ko":"정말. 지진인가 봐.","zh":"真的，好像是地震啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말.","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"지진인가","meaning":"地震","explanation":"지진：地震；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"지진","audio":"/audio/a7ceafd37d8aba2150e7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28938","senseId":"1","lemma":"지진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지진인가","audio":"/audio/6b05a0d7cd670d38d328.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"a7ceafd37d8aba21","term":"지진","zh":"地震","audio":"/audio/a7ceafd37d8aba2150e7.mp3","entryId":"28938","definition":"由于火山活动或地球内部发生巨大变化而地面颤动的现象。","pronunciation":["지진"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e361a1d326c5b0a31942.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.054,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=30206","label":"国立国语院